tays correct and October excludes\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252m\u276e\r\n\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;5;110mSeptember; leave the original reimbursement source untouched. Update the handoff with the actual command and verify the results.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mchecking how the tests call the internals before changing their shape\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252madding month filtering to \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/report.py\u001b\\report.py\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mwriting a mixed-month fixture and exercising the new flag\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252madding tests for month filtering and the CLI flag\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243m\u2514 \u001b[38;5;252mOne important correction while you work: a malformed date must not silently disappear because the month filter skips it. Report the\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;252msource line on stderr and use the same partial-report exit code 2, while continuing valid rows. Please test an impossible date as well\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;252mas a malformed --month argument.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 \u001b[38;5;103mWorking\u001b[38;5;243m thinking \u00b7 1s \u00b7 together 60 t/s \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m                                                                  \u001b[38;5;235m\u2191\u001b[38;5;243m 53.4k\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;238m\u2193\u001b[38;5;252m 9,235\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2500 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;116mdeepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m (together):auto \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;173m\u25c7 YOLO\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;243m$0.15 \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;110m\u27f2 saved $0.0530 \u00b7 87% cached\u001b[38;5;243m   \u001b[38;5;110m53.4k/1M \u00b7 5%\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;146m\u2838\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;146mworking\u001b[38;5;243m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;146m32s\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;243m\u203a \u00